517
00:26:06,520 --> 00:26:08,517
so we're going to save
him first so we can eat.

518
00:26:08,600 --> 00:26:09,776
I'm kind of worried.

519
00:26:10,040 --> 00:26:12,457
Hatchan didn't sound like
himself at all when they talked.

520
00:26:12,540 --> 00:26:14,777
I'm afraid they've done
something awful to him.

521
00:26:14,860 --> 00:26:16,557
Eh, he's tough enough to cope.

522
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:17,717
I wouldn't worry about it.

523
00:26:17,800 --> 00:26:20,537
You guys, on the other hand, were
awful quick to offer your help,

524
00:26:20,620 --> 00:26:23,477
but are you positive you're
not in over your head on this?

525
00:26:23,560 --> 00:26:24,420
You kidding?

526
00:26:24,980 --> 00:26:25,810
All right.

527
00:26:25,893 --> 00:26:26,723
Well, fair warning.

528
00:26:26,806 --> 00:26:28,737
These guys aren't the only
kidnappers in the area.

529
00:26:28,820 --> 00:26:31,257
There's a whole bunch
of crews just like him.

530
00:26:31,340 --> 00:26:34,397
The Sabaody Archipelago is
a hotspot for kidnapping.

531
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:37,186
Human trafficking is big
business around here.

532
00:26:37,860 --> 00:26:40,157
You mean like slave trading or something?

533
00:26:40,240 --> 00:26:41,400
Pretty sick stuff.

534
00:26:41,660 --> 00:26:44,477
And seeing as mermaids fetch
a high price on the market,

535
00:26:44,560 --> 00:26:46,817
A trio of fishmen that
call themselves the Macro

536
00:26:46,900 --> 00:26:49,606
Gang have been targeting
Kuma for a long time.

537
00:26:49,760 --> 00:26:52,737
We were stuck in that sea
monster's belly for a while.

538
00:26:52,820 --> 00:26:54,557
Hachi probably got worried
about us and figured

539
00:26:54,640 --> 00:26:56,337
the Macro Gang kidnapped you or something.

540
00:26:56,420 --> 00:26:59,517
Then he went after them to rescue
you and got kidnapped himself.

541
00:26:59,600 --> 00:27:01,620
Yeah, that must be it

542
00:27:02,460 --> 00:27:05,620
Hutchin's so kind, and he's
always looking after me.

543
00:27:06,160 --> 00:27:07,660
This is all my fault!

544
00:27:12,460 --> 00:27:13,857
Guys named Hatchan, huh?

545
00:27:13,940 --> 00:27:16,820
Reminds me that dumbass
octopus from way back.

546
00:27:18,700 --> 00:27:21,582
If it's that guy, there's
no way I'm helping him.

547
00:27:22,020 --> 00:27:23,617
But what are the odds, right?

548
00:27:23,700 --> 00:27:26,817
Usually Hachi can take those guys,
or anybody else for that matter.

549
00:27:26,900 --> 00:27:30,337
But with the flying fish riders
involved, it's a whole different story.

550
00:27:30,420 --> 00:27:32,126
Okay, but who are these guys?

551
00:27:32,460 --> 00:27:35,117
They're another one of those
kidnapping crews I mentioned.

552
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:37,317
They've really been
running the place lately.

553
00:27:37,400 --> 00:27:40,960
Word is, once they target you,
you're as good as done for.

554
00:27:41,580 --> 00:27:45,060
Their boss Devil is this
scary guy with an iron mask.

555
00:27:45,340 --> 00:27:47,217
Nobody knows what his face looks like.

556
00:27:47,300 --> 00:27:49,517
Anyway, it seems like
they're looking for someone.

557
00:27:49,600 --> 00:27:51,937
They've been stopping
every ship that comes by

558
00:27:52,020 --> 00:27:54,937
here and checking out their
crews member by member.

559
00:27:55,020 --> 00:27:57,197
Man, they sound like a real pain!

560
00:27:57,280 --> 00:27:58,840
Eh, how tough can they be?

561
00:27:59,020 --> 00:28:01,080
It's fine Don't worry, Kuma,

562
00:28:01,300 --> 00:28:04,657
we'll get the octopus fritters back
for sure That's fritters salesman?

563
00:28:04,740 --> 00:28:06,817
I, I'm sure you're right, luffy chin?

564
00:28:06,900 --> 00:28:08,076
Of course I'm right!

565
00:28:09,020 --> 00:28:12,491
Hey, Brooke, why don't you play
a song to lighten the mood?

566
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:14,160
With pleasure, Captain.

567
00:28:31,140 --> 00:28:34,340
What hey guys we're in trouble!

568
00:28:37,080 --> 00:28:38,217
Did something happen?

569
00:28:38,300 --> 00:28:39,130
What's the matter?

570
00:28:39,213 --> 00:28:40,317
The fish said they're sorry.

571
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:42,459
But they can't take us any further.

572
00:28:42,600 --> 00:28:43,482
They're scared.

573
00:28:43,820 --> 00:28:46,640
Wait, what? Someone's here? Ah! Look!

574
00:28:46,800 --> 00:28:48,447
It's the Flying Fish Riders!

575
00:28:52,980 --> 00:28:53,810
Where?

576
00:28:53,893 --> 00:28:55,120
I can't see anything!

577
00:28:56,380 --> 00:28:57,210
Kate! Katie!

578
00:28:57,500 --> 00:28:58,497
Where are you going?

579
00:28:58,580 --> 00:28:59,580
You have to hide!

580
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:02,600
They're in the sky, not the sea! Look up!

581
00:29:15,160 --> 00:29:16,840
Wow, they really can fly!

582
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:18,020
That's awesome!

583
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:20,087
They're our enemy, remember?

584
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:22,024
Damn it, attacking his head on?

585
00:29:22,120 --> 00:29:24,767
They have seats and
hammawars and everything!

586
00:29:27,280 --> 00:29:29,760
Hey, it's them! Yeah, you're right.

587
00:29:29,880 --> 00:29:32,137
Those are the Straw Hat Pirates
down there, no doubt about it.

588
00:29:32,220 --> 00:29:34,400
Let's contact the boss. You got it.

589
00:29:35,020 --> 00:29:37,517
I thought we'd only make
it out with the mermaid.

590
00:29:37,600 --> 00:29:38,897
This is our lucky day!

591
00:29:38,980 --> 00:29:42,392
Hey, Master Duvall's gonna be
thrilled when he hears this.

592
00:29:43,480 --> 00:29:44,840
Here they come again!

593
00:29:58,280 --> 00:30:01,600
They're dropping bombs. Jerks! Come on!

594
00:30:01,780 --> 00:30:03,780
72 caliber! Let's go!

595
00:30:11,020 --> 00:30:12,520
That was a close one.

596
00:30:12,660 --> 00:30:13,557
They're not finished.

597
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:17,557
Once they're out of the water, flying fish
can stay in the air up to five minutes.

598
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:19,257
Yep, that's right, Master Devil.

599
00:30:19,340 --> 00:30:21,417
There's no doubt in my
mind that it's them.

600
00:30:21,500 --> 00:30:22,500
Huh? Wait.

601
00:30:23,160 --> 00:30:25,278
Sorry, sir, I missed that last part.

602
00:30:26,480 --> 00:30:27,320
Turn around.

603
00:30:27,580 --> 00:30:29,017
He told us to go back to base.

604
00:30:29,100 --> 00:30:30,394
But that's ridiculous.

605
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:32,380
Boss's orders. Who knows?

606
00:30:33,280 --> 00:30:34,751
Fine, but I don't get it.

607
00:30:43,200 --> 00:30:44,460
They're gone?

608
00:30:45,840 --> 00:30:46,670
Mackerel.

609
00:30:46,920 --> 00:30:48,391
What is it, Master Devil?

610
00:30:48,660 --> 00:30:52,425
That mermaid you were luring here
is on a pirate ship right now.

611
00:30:52,540 --> 00:30:56,020
Were you aware of that? Huh? Kuma? No!

612
00:30:59,060 --> 00:31:03,220
The very pirate ship I've been
searching for all this time.

613
00:31:03,820 --> 00:31:05,440
All my suffering.

614
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:07,277
All my waiting.

615
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:13,597
will finally come to an
end i'll have my revenge

616
00:31:13,680 --> 00:31:17,960
i'll kill that bastard that ruined my life
